WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.758 --> 00:00:03.008
(laughing)

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.120
- What is this?

00:00:06.711 --> 00:00:08.760
(robot cats meowing)

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.472
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:12.512
- [Narrator] Built in sensors
allow these robot cats

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.741
to respond to petting and touch.

00:00:14.741 --> 00:00:16.061
They are designed to provide the joy

00:00:16.061 --> 00:00:18.072
and stress relief of real cats,

00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:19.651
without any of the burden.

00:00:19.651 --> 00:00:20.484
- My name is Clark.

00:00:20.484 --> 00:00:21.421
I'm a cat lover,

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:24.331
and I will adopting a
robot cat for a week.

00:00:24.331 --> 00:00:25.360
- I love cats.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.399
Cats are life.

00:00:26.399 --> 00:00:27.960
Cats are a lifestyle.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.712
Cats are my spirit.

00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:30.711
- Cats are real chill.

00:00:30.711 --> 00:00:31.661
I'm chill.

00:00:31.661 --> 00:00:32.781
Like, they do their own thing.

00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:33.861
I'll do my own thing.

00:00:33.861 --> 00:00:36.341
- You know, I already have
experience with real cats.

00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:38.672
Why not give a robot a chance?

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:40.080
- (chanting) Robot cat.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.247
Ro, no, what?

00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:44.712
(laughing)

00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:47.891
- Aww, oh my God, he's so soft.

00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:51.032
(squealing)

00:00:51.032 --> 00:00:52.131
- What?

00:00:52.131 --> 00:00:54.501
(robot cat purring)

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:56.760
- Oh my cat is gonna hate this.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.593
- Let's go.

00:00:57.593 --> 00:00:59.541
You and I are gonna best friends forever.

00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:00.374
No worries.

00:01:00.374 --> 00:01:01.491
- All right, so here we are.

00:01:01.491 --> 00:01:03.571
It's day one with my cat,

00:01:03.571 --> 00:01:06.021
and I'm excited to see if this robot cat

00:01:06.021 --> 00:01:07.872
can rival a real cat.

00:01:07.872 --> 00:01:08.705
- All right.

00:01:08.705 --> 00:01:11.512
Time to take my sweet daughter
Birdie back to Brooklyn.

00:01:11.512 --> 00:01:13.840
Let's go introduce you to your cat sister.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.080
- All right, so I'm about
to introduce my cats

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.312
to Lola right here.

00:01:18.312 --> 00:01:19.341
Hey, Lola, what's up?

00:01:19.341 --> 00:01:21.816
(mumbling) checking your cat, man.

00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:22.649
(meowing)

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.536
- [Clark] Come here.

00:01:24.536 --> 00:01:26.451
Do you not like your robot cat?

00:01:26.451 --> 00:01:28.632
You never run away from me, robot kitty.

00:01:28.632 --> 00:01:29.960
- [Brenda] Oh my God.

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:30.896
Who did that?

00:01:30.896 --> 00:01:31.729
Look.

00:01:31.729 --> 00:01:32.562
(meowing)

00:01:32.562 --> 00:01:33.840
She's comfortable with you guys.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:35.099
Belly up means that shit,

00:01:35.099 --> 00:01:36.511
you know what that means?

00:01:36.511 --> 00:01:38.201
Someone on the train was like

00:01:38.201 --> 00:01:41.361
trying to get Stella's
attention, which was hilarious.

00:01:41.361 --> 00:01:44.122
I'm like, she's not real.

00:01:44.122 --> 00:01:46.482
- [Clark] Its back legs don't do anything.

00:01:46.482 --> 00:01:48.612
It's got joints like it's supposed to,

00:01:48.612 --> 00:01:50.023
so I wonder if it's broken.

00:01:50.023 --> 00:01:52.440
- The one really cute feature

00:01:53.438 --> 00:01:55.598
is that when the cat is left on,

00:01:55.598 --> 00:01:58.148
and you don't pet her or anything,

00:01:58.148 --> 00:02:00.097
she'll actually go to sleep,

00:02:00.097 --> 00:02:01.477
and she starts snoring,

00:02:01.477 --> 00:02:03.028
like it's suddenly so cute.

00:02:03.028 --> 00:02:03.861
When I have work to do,

00:02:03.861 --> 00:02:05.268
I'll just put her on mute,

00:02:05.268 --> 00:02:06.668
or turn her off.

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:09.588
- [Clark] My cat is doing
really well at my desk.

00:02:09.588 --> 00:02:11.537
my coworker's with her.

00:02:11.537 --> 00:02:13.068
- This is disgusting.

00:02:13.068 --> 00:02:14.009
(laughing)

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:15.708
And I love cats.

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:17.697
- It's not nearly as cool
as I thought it would be.

00:02:17.697 --> 00:02:19.798
- So we're about to walk into --

00:02:19.798 --> 00:02:20.688
(robot cat meowing)

00:02:20.688 --> 00:02:21.918
Yes, that's right, Lola.

00:02:21.918 --> 00:02:23.489
Our final interview.

00:02:23.489 --> 00:02:26.137
You and I had amazing times together.

00:02:26.137 --> 00:02:28.068
- It feels like actual company,

00:02:28.068 --> 00:02:31.577
and it provides that peaceful moment

00:02:31.577 --> 00:02:34.289
that cats are sometimes able to deliver.

00:02:34.289 --> 00:02:36.095
So my week with Lola right here

00:02:36.095 --> 00:02:37.748
has been very interesting.

00:02:37.748 --> 00:02:40.158
It really reminds me of my real cats,

00:02:40.158 --> 00:02:41.268
when they're behaving,

00:02:41.268 --> 00:02:43.788
which means when they're
hungry and they need me.

00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:47.209
- I'm lazy, so not having to feed the cat,

00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:50.089
or honestly, maintain it at all was great.

00:02:50.089 --> 00:02:51.437
- If what you're looking for in a cat

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:52.897
is emotional support,

00:02:52.897 --> 00:02:54.028
this could do the trick.

00:02:54.028 --> 00:02:55.169
This could do the job.

00:02:55.169 --> 00:02:57.937
- But it did make me appreciate
the touch of a real kitters,

00:02:57.937 --> 00:02:59.536
the response of a real kitters.

00:02:59.536 --> 00:03:01.068
- The best part about owning a cat

00:03:01.068 --> 00:03:02.796
is like winning it over.

00:03:02.796 --> 00:03:03.868
I prefer to work for it.

00:03:03.868 --> 00:03:07.447
I don't want a robot that
just likes me instantly.

00:03:07.447 --> 00:03:09.838
- So there's a lot of things
a robot kitters are good for,

00:03:09.838 --> 00:03:11.297
but when you got the
real thing in your life,

00:03:11.297 --> 00:03:13.129
don't settle for a robot.

00:03:13.129 --> 00:03:15.969
(robot cat meowing)

00:03:15.969 --> 00:03:18.552
(upbeat music)

